==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Finizen|60}} from the {{TCG|Obsidian Flames}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Razor Fin''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Team Aqua's Carvanha|48}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

